WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.023
Roxy arrived at the museum.

2
00:00:03.024 --> 00:00:07.651
Detective Smith was inspecting the display case and taking notes.

3
00:00:07.652 --> 00:00:12.974
Roxy grinned. "Are you taking notes for a school project, Detective?

4
00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:16.677
It's probably too late for you to get extra credit."

5
00:00:16.678 --> 00:00:21.071
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl," Detective Smith said.

6
00:00:21.072 --> 00:00:23.679
The two security guards hurried over.

7
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.611
"The thieves were ninjas!" Bob said.

8
00:00:26.612 --> 00:00:30.244
Detective Smith stood up. "Ninjas?"

9
00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:34.237
"Yes. They stole the Jade Dragon vase," the other guard said.

10
00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:37.796
"And they escaped without touching the laser beams."

11
00:00:37.797 --> 00:00:40.641
"Laser beams?" Roxy said.

12
00:00:40.642 --> 00:00:46.960
Bob nodded. He typed some numbers into a keypad on the wall.

13
00:00:46.961 --> 00:00:49.817
Laser beams appeared all around.

14
00:00:49.818 --> 00:00:52.823
"It's a high-tech security system," he said.

15
00:00:52.824 --> 00:00:56.973
"The alarm goes off when something touches the beams."

16
00:00:56.974 --> 00:01:01.009
"Can you tell us anything else about the thieves?" Roxy asked.

17
00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.338
"I thought they were kids," Bob said.

18
00:01:04.339 --> 00:01:08.436
"But kids probably wouldn't steal a priceless vase."

19
00:01:08.437 --> 00:01:12.618
The second guard nodded. "They were all dressed in black.

20
00:01:12.619 --> 00:01:16.561
And there was a red bird symbol on their back.

21
00:01:16.562 --> 00:01:19.119
I think it was an ostrich."

22
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.758
Bob shook his head. "It was a flamingo."

23
00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:27.157
Roxy thought for a moment. "Was it a crane?"

24
00:01:27.158 --> 00:01:29.164
The guards shrugged.

25
00:01:29.165 --> 00:01:33.894
"Hmm," Roxy said. "There's a new karate studio.

26
00:01:33.895 --> 00:01:39.005
Something seemed strange about it. And its logo is a crane." "Maybe

27
00:01:39.006 --> 00:01:42.518
you should talk to the owner," Detective Smith said. "I'll

28
00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:45.933
check the display case—Rocket Girl?" As

29
00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:52.925
he spun around, his foot crossed a laser beam. An alarm sounded. "Oops,"

30
00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:55.947
Detective Smith said. ***

31
00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:59.304
Roxy flew to Red Crane Karate Studio.

32
00:01:59.305 --> 00:02:02.210
Inside, two students were practicing fighting.

33
00:02:02.211 --> 00:02:04.785
Others stood at attention, watching them.

34
00:02:04.786 --> 00:02:07.954
Suddenly the sensei hit a gong. Dong!

35
00:02:07.955 --> 00:02:11.831
The students froze and bowed to him.

36
00:02:11.832 --> 00:02:14.991
"Welcome, Rocket Girl," the sensei said.

37
00:02:14.992 --> 00:02:19.229
"I’m Sensei Spike. Have you come to learn from me?"

38
00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:22.223
"Um . . . not today," Roxy said.

39
00:02:22.224 --> 00:02:25.107
"A vase was stolen from the museum."

40
00:02:25.108 --> 00:02:27.217
She pointed to the studio's logo.

41
00:02:27.218 --> 00:02:30.725
"And the thieves' clothes had a picture of a crane."

42
00:02:30.726 --> 00:02:35.442
Spike frowned. "Are you saying my students are involved?"

43
00:02:35.443 --> 00:02:38.822
Roxy shrugged. "We're not sure yet."

44
00:02:38.823 --> 00:02:43.467
"Well, none of my students did anything wrong," Spike snapped.

45
00:02:43.468 --> 00:02:47.591
"Now please leave. You're distracting these karate students!"

46
00:02:47.592 --> 00:02:50.031
Roxy turned back to the kids.

47
00:02:50.032 --> 00:02:53.006
They were all staring ahead without blinking.

48
00:02:53.007 --> 00:02:57.720
"Are they okay, Sensei? They look like they're in a trance."

49
00:02:57.721 --> 00:03:01.539
Spike smiled. "They understand discipline.

50
00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.451
My newest student will give you a short demonstration."

51
00:03:05.452 --> 00:03:08.725
He waved a hand, and the newest student came forward.

52
00:03:08.726 --> 00:03:14.930
Roxy gasped. It was Jack!

